    <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#232F3E;margin:0 0 14px 0;">The global cross-border payments industry loses an estimated <strong style="font-weight:700;">$8&#8211;12 billion annually</strong> to address-related payment exceptions. That figure sounds abstract until you decompose it into your institution&#8217;s share.</p>

