    <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#232F3E;margin:0 0 14px 0;">These costs are structural. They don&#8217;t fluctuate with market conditions or shrink with headcount reductions. They recur every year and scale with transaction volume. The root cause is the structural mismatch between free-text address capture and structured XML transmission — and hybrid-only compliance doesn&#8217;t resolve that mismatch.</p>

